  "locales": {
    "en": {
      "trackName": "PetBox: Virtual Pet Companion",
      "description": "Build a daily routine with your own virtual pet in PetBox.\n\nFeed, clean, pet and rest together while caring for fullness, cleanliness, mood and energy. Open Star Boxes, discover eight original companions and their growth forms, and complete daily tasks.\n\nDecorate your room and explore Companion Life. Room themes, conversations and sound change with the time of day. Chat with your pet through the AI companion in your home.\n\nCheck and care for your companion on Apple Watch, and keep pet status close with widgets. The interface supports English, Simplified and Traditional Chinese, Japanese, Korean, French, German and Spanish. Unsupported interface languages use English. Player-entered pet nicknames and saved conversations keep their original text.\n\nStart with a guest profile or use Sign in with Apple and profile recovery. In-app purchases use Apple StoreKit. Randomized content displays its probabilities and guarantee rules before purchase.\n\nAI companion replies are for entertainment. Please do not enter passwords, payment information or other sensitive data.\n\nTerms of Use (Apple Standard EULA): https://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/",
      "releaseNotes": "Adds French, German and Spanish interfaces, completes eight-language store localizations, and localizes Watch and widget copy. Known bundled themed-box and species names now follow the interface language. Existing pet names, conversations, odds, purchases and progress are preserved.",
      "trackViewUrl": "https://apps.apple.com/us/app/petbox-virtual-pet-companion/id6790362436?uo=4",
